{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_02_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_02","title":"粗細有別","storyCode":"RI-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"73d29481aa126f87d843a0177052f0cd1eeee718c0241763ff1a7b9fc39d220e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"噫，這、這招死亡大風車......還有這個髮夾......你、你難道是嘉維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"正是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，遇到你算我們倒楣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，就算你是嘉維爾，也別想動搖我們對粗尾巴的信仰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這麼囂張就別逃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們走吧，下次碰到了再收拾他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，你怎麼放過他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的你，遇到這種事肯定會把他們全追上打暈才解氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，以前的我會這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我現在覺得他們還挺可愛的，對吧，博士。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"雖然聽不懂，不過確實。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然由我來說可能比較奇怪，不過這裡都是些頭腦簡單的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，在外面動不動就要花腦力，有時候我也會懷念這裡。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，你該不會也覺得粗尾巴比較好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不同意啊！"}]},{"label":"暴揍他們的你比較不可愛。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！雖然我覺得他們可愛，但並不妨礙我揍他們啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"這叫怎麼說來著，對了，一碼歸一碼！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾......真的和以前不一樣了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？等等，特米米，你這丫頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"幾年不見，你的尾巴又變粗了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"誒誒誒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你該不會也是粗尾巴那一邊的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有沒有，我也不是自己想它才變這麼粗的呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚，我也想要嘉維爾一樣的細尾巴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊，嘖嘖，真是個可憐的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，剛才戰鬥的時候看了看，你的源石技藝變得挺厲害了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，來我們羅德島做個幹員應該都沒問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"幹......員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員就是呃，反正就是幹活的，比如我就是醫療幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得我走的時候你還在巫醫那裡學習吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！為了嘉維爾能夠回來，我每天都在磨練自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"為了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......唔，我是說，為了嘉維爾回來的時候能夠幫上忙！就像剛才那樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那你確實幫上了忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"誒嘿嘿......被嘉維爾誇獎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，總而言之，繼續前進吧，我記得神廟就在前面不遠了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"森蚺絕對是大酋長啊，他們部族這麼厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，而且她自己也很強，以前不都說除了嘉維爾，就是森蚺了，現在嘉維爾不在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，看那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"那個難道是，嘉維爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，嘉維爾，你終於回來了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，好久不見啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你腰上這根羽毛這麼好看，哪裡來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我用武器去跟依娜姆大姐換的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你們部族真好，依娜姆大姐什麼都搞得到，我也想去你們部族啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，依娜姆大姐最討厭人多了，不過你們要是有什麼想要的，可以問我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！......喂，看那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，難道是嘉維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"她居然回來了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，你原來沒死啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我活得好好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥，別逞強了，你都得了石頭病了，還是在家好好躺著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了，一點小病比起祭典算什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然是小病，但也是病啊！而且要是讓別人看到我哥哥尾巴上長出石頭，那多丟人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"而且嘉維爾不在，大酋長肯定是祖瑪瑪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是要見證祖瑪瑪當上酋長的那一刻啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，我不該不聽祖瑪瑪的話......嗯？弟弟，看那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧，那個人是......嘉維爾？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"她難道回來爭大酋長了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"......弟弟，抱歉，這下看來我必須去看祭典了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，哥哥，這下確實不看不行了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，那兩個人，好像是森蚺部族的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是嘉維爾！你終於回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，我一直相信你的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，大夥，快看，是嘉維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，嘉維爾，嘉維爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"真是群熱鬧的傢伙......我們還是走快點吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，畢竟大家都很喜歡祭典呢，也都很喜歡嘉維爾呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嘉維爾，看前面那塊板子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看，嘖，寫的什麼破字......哦，就是寫的“瑪維索提亞”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這裡怎麼會有音樂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這音樂怎麼有些耳熟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，這不是AUS的歌嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"確實。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我不太懂，但是聽其他人偶爾放也有印象。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，別陶醉進去聽啊！"}]},{"label":"是嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島上也有不少這支樂隊的粉絲，應該沒錯。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，確實是AUS的歌呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼也知道AUS？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"大約去年的時候，有一群自稱AUS的奇怪外鄉人來過這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"她們先是在依娜姆的部族那裡進行了一次演唱會，這場演唱會過後，很多提亞卡烏都把她們當成“瑪維索提亞”的使者來對待了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"然後她們就被請求留在這裡進行了相當長一段時間的演出，而且演出的地點基本都是在神廟那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有聽過一次，確實是很厲害很好聽的音樂呢......而且能感覺到很厲害的法術技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，許多提亞卡烏就愛上了這種音樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"然後有一天，她們就又忽然消失了，大家都說她們是回到先祖的懷抱去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我知道她們只是和嘉維爾你一樣離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡播放的音樂應該是有人把她們離開時留下的叫做“音響”的東西搬過來了，她們離開前，好像還留下了許多她們的唱片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"音響？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，因為是需要法術技巧才能使用的東西，所以只有祭祀和巫醫們能夠使用它們，平時應該都是放在依娜姆的部族裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，這支樂隊還真是自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"而且她們的音樂確實很刺激，我還沒進去就已經有些熱血沸騰起來了，我開始喜歡上她們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，博士，我們進去一邊聽音樂，一邊享受祭典！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉維爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]}]}
